<title>THAILAND: Thai Farmers Bank cuts rate by 25 bps.</title>
<headline>Thai Farmers Bank cuts rate by 25 bps.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1997-04-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Thai Farmers Bank on Monday said it would cut its minimum lending rate by 25 basis point to 13.00 percent, effective from Tuesday.</p>
</text>
